# Byte-exact checkout, everywhere.
#
# tier1/tests/test_gait_mask_anon.py asserts that the vendored re-identification defence modules
# hash to the SHA-256 digests recorded in tier1/src/mirage/vendor/mirage_edge/VENDOR.md - the same
# bytes every published privacy number was measured against. Any line-ending normalisation silently
# changes those digests and breaks the measurement -> source -> artifact provenance chain for
# anyone who clones the repository.
#
# So: no text conversion at all. Files are checked out exactly as committed.
* -text

# Keep GitHub's language statistics honest about vendored and generated content.
tier1/src/mirage/vendor/** linguist-vendored
workflows/tier2_cloud/*.json    linguist-generated
examples/**                     linguist-documentation
